  <name>KikuMoe</name>
  <summary>LISTEN.moe desktop radio player</summary>
  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>
      KikuMoe is a desktop radio player for LISTEN.moe, supporting J-POP and
      K-POP streams in Vorbis or MP3 format. It features multiple audio backends
      (FFmpeg, MPV, VLC), system tray integration, sleep timer, and a developer
      console.
    </p>
